{"title": "Five levels of trader", "type": "Trader levels", "hooks": ["Your trading at five levels: only level five sets a stop.", "Your life at five levels of trader, and the stop that saves you.", "Five levels of trader. Only one sets the stop first."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Your trading at five levels: only level five sets a stop.", "text": "Five levels of trader", "chart": null}, {"kind": "stick", "head": "Level 1", "vo": "Level one buys whatever just went up. Green candle? Buy it. No plan, no stop.", "figures": [{"pose": "stand", "label": "Level 1", "color": "white"}], "cues": [{"say": "Green candle", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "happy"}, {"say": "Buy it", "do": "bubble", "fig": 0, "text": "It's green, buy!"}, {"say": "No plan, no stop", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "shrug"}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "stick", "chart": 0, "head": "Level 2", "show": 70, "vo": "Level two sells the second Redfield Skies breaks its 20-candle low. Volume was 1.9 times normal. Within six candles, it was back inside.", "figures": [{"pose": "stand", "label": "Level 2", "color": "amber"}], "cues": [{"say": "breaks its 20-candle low", "do": "line", "price": 69.76, "label": "20-candle low", "tone": "amber"}, {"say": "breaks its 20-candle low", "do": "reveal", "to": 90}, {"say": "Volume was 1.9 times normal", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "point"}, {"say": "Volume was 1.9 times normal", "do": "bubble", "fig": 0, "text": "Breakdown! Sell!"}, {"say": "Within six candles", "do": "reveal", "to": 96}, {"say": "back inside", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "panic"}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "stick", "head": "Level 3", "vo": "Level three has been fooled before. Now she waits for a close beyond the level, not just a wick.", "figures": [{"pose": "sad", "label": "Level 3", "color": "white"}], "cues": [{"say": "waits for a close", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "think"}, {"say": "not just a wick", "do": "bubble", "fig": 0, "text": "Close, not wick"}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "stick", "head": "Level 4", "vo": "Level four wants more: volume that grows on the break, and a retest that holds.", "figures": [{"pose": "stand", "label": "Level 4", "color": "white"}], "cues": [{"say": "volume that grows", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "point"}, {"say": "a retest that holds", "do": "bubble", "fig": 0, "text": "Show me the retest"}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "stick", "head": "Level 5", "vo": "Level five knows breakouts fail often. So the stop goes in first, just inside the old range.", "figures": [{"pose": "walk", "label": "Level 5", "color": "teal"}], "cues": [{"say": "breakouts fail often", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "stand"}, {"say": "the stop goes in first", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "happy"}, {"say": "the stop goes in first", "do": "bubble", "fig": 0, "text": "Stop first, then trade"}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Which level are you?", "vo": "Comment your level, then practise at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "Every trader starts at level one. Which level are you?\n\nRedfield Skies closed below its 20-candle low on 1.9 times normal volume.\nWithin six candles it was back inside the range.\nBreakouts fail often. Level five puts the stop in first.\n\nComment your level below.\nPractise at memestreet.net\nFictional market. Not investment advice.\n\n#MemeStreet #Breakout #StopLoss #LearnToTrade", "charts": [{"candles": [[77.0, 78.29, 76.83, 78.09, 22736], [78.1, 78.76, 77.59, 77.82, 68918], [77.81, 78.46, 77.55, 77.94, 86808], [77.91, 79.07, 77.08, 78.97, 102976], [78.98, 79.33, 78.07, 78.08, 59448], [78.08, 81.02, 78.0, 80.37, 117032], [80.4, 80.67, 75.85, 76.79, 138333], [76.78, 78.06, 75.54, 76.95, 124603], [77.01, 77.47, 76.53, 76.8, 73551], [76.77, 76.81, 67.09, 68.16, 224944], [68.15, 68.94, 67.92, 68.45, 102329], [68.46, 69.13, 67.69, 68.61, 108099], [68.63, 68.91, 68.18, 68.61, 74462], [68.61, 69.18, 65.35, 65.98, 108097], [65.97, 67.57, 65.88, 67.35, 92914], [67.35, 69.57, 67.29, 69.57, 35738